## Erlang VM configuration

## Node name (distributed mode)
-name myapp@192.168.1.10

## Cluster cookie (security secret - keep private!)
-setcookie my_cluster_secret_cookie

## Heartbeat monitoring
-heart

## Increase number of concurrent processes
+P 1048576

## Max number of ports
+Q 65536

## Kernel poll
+K true

## Async threads
+A 64

## Schedulers (online:total)
+S 8:8

## Warnings as errors
+W w

## Memory allocator settings
+MBas aoffcbf
+MHas aoffcbf
+MSas aoffcbf

## Increase ETS table limit
-env ERL_MAX_ETS_TABLES 50000

## Enable distribution over TLS
-proto_dist inet_tls
-ssl_dist_optfile /app/etc/ssl_dist.conf

## Initial call for crash dumping
+zdbbl 32768
